/Title (AN3150, Soldering Recommendations for Pressure Sensor Devices - Application Notes)
/Author ( Freescale Semiconductor, Inc.)
/Subject (AN3150: Pressure sensor devices require the internal cavity containing the silicon transducer to be exposed to ambient in order for the device to function. Exposed cavity packages require special considerations during board assembly to prevent damage to the device during soldering and subsequent cleaning operations.)
/Keywords (AN3150, Soldering Recommendations, Pressure Sensor Devices, silicon transducer, Exposed cavity packages)
